<title>USA: Diehl Graphsoft Inc Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Diehl Graphsoft Inc Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>DIEHL GRAPHSOFT INC.</p>
<p>				For the three months ended August 31,</p>
<p>						  1996		  1995</p>
<p> Sales				  $1,725,805	     $862,688</p>
<p> Gross profit			  1,354,475		673,592</p>
<p> Total operating expenses	    890,153		555,081</p>
<p> Income from operations		464,322		118,511</p>
<p> Income before income taxes	  556,027		188,081</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes	  203,050		 66,700</p>
<p> Net income				352,977		121,381</p>
<p> Net income per share			.11		    .04</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>  of shares outstanding	    3,172,472	    2,895,810</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
